        "created_at": "2019-02-25T21:40:12.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>To answer your question about balance, Fixer does have some good cards and combos.&nbsp; However, his best combos revolve around Dual Crowbars or Jack Handle, and he has no way to dig for those.&nbsp; He has great potential but he's inconsistent.</p>",
